OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor first to defect from
OL,4,AReform to Labour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA county councillor has become the
OL,7,Ffirst politician in the country to
OL,8,Fdefect from Reform UK to the Labour
OL,9,Fparty.
OL,11,FNigel Swales was elected to Lancashire
OL,12,FCounty Council in May 2025 and
OL,13,Frepresents Skelmersdale East.
OL,15,FHe said his decision to join Labour
OL,16,Fcame after "growing concerns about
OL,17,FReform's ability to deliver at a local
OL,18,Flevel."
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
